flowchart LR

  subgraph USER[Interactive Windows User Session]
    MGR[SplitOS Manager]
    GUX[Game Launcher]
    RH[SplitOS Runtime Host]
    WINUI[User-session Windows APIs]
    GC[Game Client Adapters]
  end

  subgraph SYS[Session 0 / Privileged System Context]
    PB[SplitOS Privileged Broker\nWindows Service]
    SCM[SCM / protected machine operations]
  end

  subgraph EXT[External Systems]
    ID[SplitOS Account Backend]
    PAY[Payment Provider]
    STEAM[Steam]
    EPIC[Epic Games]
    XBOX[Xbox / Microsoft Store]
    BNET[Battle.net]
  end

  subgraph BUILD[Build / Release]
    SRC[Microsoft-authorized Windows Source]
    MB[SplitOS Media Builder]
    DISM[DISM / Offline Servicing]
    UPD[Microsoft Update / Patch Source]
    COMPAT[Compatibility Management]
  end

  MGR -->|semantic requests/queries| RH
  GUX -->|game/mode requests| RH

  RH -->|user-session integration| WINUI
  RH -->|secured named-pipe IPC| PB
  PB -->|allowlisted privileged operations| SCM

  RH -->|HTTPS account/entitlement| ID
  MGR -->|checkout request| ID
  ID -->|hosted checkout| PAY
  PAY -->|validated payment evidence| ID

  RH --> GC
  GC --> STEAM
  GC --> EPIC
  GC --> XBOX
  GC --> BNET

  SRC --> MB
  MB --> DISM
  DISM -->|prepared baseline| MB

  UPD --> COMPAT
  COMPAT -->|supported update decision| RH
  RH -->|privileged apply when required| PB

  WINUI -.actual state evidence.-> RH
  GC -.client/game evidence.-> RH
  PB -.operation result/evidence.-> RH
  ID -.entitlement evidence.-> RH